libcmmk
------------------------------------------
Unofficial LED control API for Coolermaster Masterkey keyboards

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcmmk-devel-0.2.0+git20260224-1bl1
  libcmmk0-0.2.0+git20260224-1bl1
  libhidapi-devel-0.15.0-1bl2
  libhidapi0-0.15.0-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libhidapi-devel-0.15.0-1bl2
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/chmod222/libcmmk

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/chmod222/libcmmk.git

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libcmmk-0.2.0+git20260224-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libcmmk-0.2.0+git20260224-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libcmmk-0.2.0+git20260224-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcmmk-0.2.0+git20260224-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcmmk0-0.2.0+git20260224-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcmmk-devel-0.2.0+git20260224-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libcmmk)
  /usr/bin/cmmk-debug.exe
  /usr/bin/cmmk-test.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libcmmk.README
  /usr/share/doc/libcmmk/CoolerMaster LED Table.xls
  /usr/share/doc/libcmmk/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/libcmmk/PROTOCOL.md
  /usr/share/doc/libcmmk/README.md

(libcmmk0)
  /usr/bin/cygcmmk-0.dll

(libcmmk-devel)
  /usr/include/libcmmk/libcmmk-config.h
  /usr/include/libcmmk/libcmmk.h
  /usr/lib/libcmmk.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libcmmk.pc

